    "description": "Optional parameters are parameters fitted with a default value. They may then be skipped when the function is called.\n\nOptional parameters should be the last parameters: otherwise, PHP will have trouble figuring out which parameter uses which value.",
    "code": "<?php\n\nfunction trumpet($trunk, $tusk = 2) { }\n\n// $tusk will be 2, using the default value\ntrumpet(1);\n\n// $tusk will be 3\ntrumpet(1, 3);\n\n?>",
